<h3>Get Involved</h3><br />
<b>How Can You Get Involved?</b>
<p>We welcome all financial and /or volunteer service contributions   to the organization. As a 501(c)(3) non-profit, <b><u>all contributions are   fully tax Deductible in accordance with IRS regulations</u></b>. CommuniCare is properly registered with the State of NC and is licensed   by the Secretary of State for nonprofit solicitations (license #<b>SL   001988</b>)</p>
<p>You may contribute in the following ways: </p>
<b>On-line Contribution</b>
<p>To donate on-line using the Network for Good secured server   site, click on the "Network for Good" icon below. You will be sent to a <u>secure server</u> where you may use your credit card. </p>
<p><a href="https://www.networkforgood.org/donate/MakeDonation2.aspx?ORGID2=562086735" title="Click here to donate securely to CommuniCare - " mce_href="https://www.networkforgood.org/donate/MakeDonation2.aspx?ORGID2=562086735" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.dayspringindy.org/images/networkForGood.gif" title="Network for Good logo" alt="Network for Good logo" mce_src="http://www.dayspringindy.org/images/networkForGood.gif" border="0" height="75" width="149"></a></p>
OR....you can donate directly to us by   contacting our main number and we will take your information to make it as easy   as possible for you --- we'll contact you and discuss how you would like to work   with us, either through a cash pledge or by volunteering. Please help --- your   contributions are fully tax deductible (as allowable by the IRS) and go very far   toward helping our most vulnerable families.
<br /><br /><b>Volunteer Time and /or Services</b>
<p>To volunteer time and / or professional services, please contact   us at the address and phone number below. </p>

